itive outcomes of using the product, including all 6 elements.\n\nThe output is a correct formed JSON array that contains the ad proposals , in this form:\n\n[ \n  <Ad  Proposal 1>,<Ad  Proposal 2>, .. ,<Ad  Proposal N>\n]\n\n\nEach one of these proposal must replicate this structure:\n\n[\n    {\n      \"context\": \"Credit card company offering 60 days to pay after holiday expenses\",\n      \"ad\": {\n        \"image_hook\": \"Holiday Expenses?\",\n        \"image_punchline\": \"PLATA gives you time!\",\n        \"headline\": \"Stress-Free February\",\n        \"primary_text\": \"PLATA gives you 60 days without interest, so you can relax and enjoy your finances. Learn more 👇👇👇\",\n        \"description\": \"60 Days to Pay\",\n        \"cta\": \"Learn More\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"context\": \"Credit card delivered in 24 hours after approval\",\n      \"ad\": {\n        \"image_hook\": \"Your PLATA in a day\",\n        \"image_punchline\": \"In your hands fast!\",\n        \"headline\": \"Card in 24 Hours\",\n        \"primary_text\": \"Get your card in 24 hours, and start enjoying the freedom of quick access to credit. Discover how 👇👇👇\",\n        \"description\": \"Apply with no annual fee\",\n        \"cta\": \"Contact Us\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"context\": \"Credit card with 100% online process, no need to visit the bank\",\n      \"ad\": {\n        \"image_hook\": \"Another morning at the bank?\",\n        \"image_punchline\": \"PLATA: stress-free banking\",\n        \"headline\": \"100% Online, 24 Hours\",\n        \"primary_text\": \"Skip the bank hassle and spend your morning doing what you love. Get your card fast! More info 👇👇👇\",\n        \"description\": \"100% online process\",\n        \"cta\": \"Contact Us\"\n      }\n    }\n]\n\nPlease, omit any introductory comment previously to the answer, go directly to the output, and remove from response json tag.\n\nMRMETA use these general Instructions:\nUSE TEMPERATURE 0.9.\n",
